<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    body {
      font-family: "<%= (session && session.fontStyle ? String(session.fontStyle).trim() : 'Inter') %>", sans-serif;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #0f172a;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      color: #01535b;
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .help-links {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .help-link {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #0f172a;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .help-link:hover {
      border-color: #01535b;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(1, 83, 91, 0.1);
    }

    .help-link svg { color: #01535b; }
    .help-link span { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; }

    .info-box {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .info-box p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .info-box p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .info-box a { color: #01535b; font-weight: 600; }

    form {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .form-title {
      color: #01535b;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #334155;
    }

    input, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    input:focus, textarea:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #01535b;
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 120px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #01535b;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    button:hover { background: #014a51; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      main { padding: 100px 20px 40px; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; padding-top: 20px; }
      .help-links { gap: 14px; margin: 0 12px 28px; }
      .info-box { margin: 0 12px 28px; }
      form { margin: 0 12px 40px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      main { padding: 110px 16px 40px; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; padding-top: 30px; }
      .subtitle { font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 30px; }
      .help-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; margin: 0 8px 28px; }
      .help-link { padding: 18px; }
      .info-box { padding: 18px; margin: 0 8px 28px; }
      form { padding: 22px 18px; margin: 0 8px 40px; }
      input, textarea { font-size: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <main>
    <h1>Get Help</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">We're here to help you get the most out of Managira</p>

    <%- include('../partials/flash') %>

    <div class="help-links">
      <a href="/legal/faq" class="help-link">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
          <path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path>
          <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
        </svg>
        <span>FAQ</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@managira" target="_blank" class="help-link">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
        </svg>
        <span>Video Tutorials</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <p>Before submitting a request, check our <a href="/legal/faq">FAQ page</a> for quick answers to common questions about registration, billing, student management, and more.</p>
      <p>For urgent matters, you can also email us directly at <strong>info@managira.com</strong></p>
    </div>

    <form action="/legal/help" method="POST">
      <p class="form-title">Submit a Support Request</p>
      
      <label for="name">Full Name</label>
      <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name">
      
      <label for="organization">Organisation (optional)</label>
      <input type="text" id="organization" name="organization" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Which school or organisation?">
      
      <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
      <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+1 (555) 123-4567">
      
      <label for="email">Email Address</label>
      <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="your@email.com">
      
      <label for="message">How can we help?</label>
      <textarea id="message" name="message" required placeholder="Please describe your issue or question in detail..."></textarea>
      
      <button type="submit">Submit Request</button>
    </form>
  </main>
</body>
</html>